sequenceDiagram
    %% SD7 - Review usage and staff information
    %% Stories: 26, 30, 44, 46, 50
    %% Description: Superusers and facility representatives view user statistics for their center, an admin handles user activities and views a usage dashboard, and HR views employee information.
    actor SU as Superuser
    actor RR as Facility representative
    actor AD as Admin
    actor HR as HR employee
    participant RF as RecyclingFacility
    participant SC as Schedule
    participant U as User
    participant WT as WasteType
    participant AC as Activity
    participant EM as Employee

    %% covers 44
    SU->>RF: view user stats and their waste
    %% covers 50
    RR->>RF: view user stats and schedules
    RF->>SC: schedule
    SC->>U: users planning drop-offs
    RF->>WT: waste types
    %% covers 30
    AD->>AC: handle users' activities
    AC->>U: user of the activity
    AC->>WT: recycled waste type
    %% covers 46
    AD->>AC: view usage dashboard
    %% covers 26
    HR->>EM: view information of all employees
